":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally (rebased on top of `master` https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/6b5b84c0c50135e88691e035d3e00c68a2ae5aa4), it works as expected.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_pr_102366.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19439820/test_pr_102366.zip)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ba0ff615-25a8-48b8-a087-eda1e2e8b806\r\n\r\nForward+ | Mobile | Compatibility\r\n-|-|-\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/88723268-5c49-42ff-baaa-dc79987b9f8d) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/419f37c9-0074-4341-8c74-4cc9a63b1a65) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6b65544c-e597-4f09-9deb-666ab7b8c3dc)\r\n\r\nSome of the materials in the testing project look noticeably different when using Compatibility. I'm not sure if this is a bug or a limitation or what's available in Compatibility, so please check this.\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- There's no autocompletion for `blend_factors` options, which impacts usability.\r\n- If you specify less than 4 arguments (or more than 4), you'll get a cryptic error message:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c2040e9-8d0d-4c8a-9ea2-e0cdae8c4534)\r\n\r\nInstead, a dedicated error should be shown to mention that `blend_factors` accepts exactly 4 arguments separated by commas.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102366#pullrequestreview-2711981712","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102366","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102366#pullrequestreview-2711981712"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102366"}},"submitted_at":"2025-03-25T00:46:50Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2776970301,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6lhTQ9","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":